Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Adesh Deshmukh <adeshkd123@gmail.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/AdeshDeshmukh/cadence
Description: Local AI-first voice dictation CLI and developer engine
 Cadence is a local, high-performance, private voice dictation and developer engine.
 Features on-device speech-to-text, real-time voice editing, terminal commands,
 meeting recording, and Model Context Protocol (MCP) agent execution.
